{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です¨̮"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single Double A-side Single\nLonesome rabbit/What's“KAZOKU”？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日発売いたしました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも応援してくださりありがとうございます\nこうしてシングルを発売できるのは皆さんのおかげです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初の両A面Singleです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobTqetJW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob0jHmbj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "SHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんに訪店させていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎シングル素敵な空間を作ってくださっています\nいつもありがとうございます！\nぜひ足を運んでみてください~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は、\nBACKS曲の「コインランドリー」「狼たちよ」\n四期生曲の「We got your back」「各駅停車」\nの歌唱メンバーとして参加させていただいています¨̮"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「Lonesome rabbit」「What's “KAZOKU”？」\n「恵まれすぎて」含め、全7曲収録されています⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どの楽曲もそれぞれ色があって好きです~\nぜひたくさん聴いてください👂🏻“"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVはこちらから↓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「Lonesome rabbit」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/4HfAH746QJo?si=nMNAoYcnIo8rJZG8"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「What's “KAZOKU”？」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/4SdeuouXcWI?si=JG3IWqDEOujh5IxT"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「コインランドリー」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ae6N-FcsJmQ?si=XiFyZ39bzHMwePQy"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、今シングルもよろしくお願いします☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクコイリアルイベント\nありがとうございました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とてもとても楽しかった☺︎\n緊張してたけど、暖かく迎え入れてくださってそこからは最後まで楽しめました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "好きなものビンゴと〇‪✕‬‪クイズ！！\nちょっと難しいのもあったけど、これらを通してもっともっと私のこと知ってくれたかな~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobRqq7JJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この髪型はまってる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あの約束、叶えます、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またカレシに会いたいな...\nありがとうございました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢15th Single オンラインミーグリ\n第6次受付が始まりました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "受付期間は、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日6月10日(水)14:00から明日6月11日(木)14:00"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "となっております！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう4日後にはミーグリが始まるということでとても楽しみです~\nもっと皆さんとお話したいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "待ってます~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢月刊タウン情報おかやま7月号"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "インタビューを掲載していただきます！\n地元岡山のお仕事、とても嬉しいです🍑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6月25日(木)発売予定です！\nぜひお手に取ってみてください~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は、暑かったり、少し肌寒かったり、大雨だったり、、\n天気に振り回されがちですが、めげずに頑張ろうね~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後までブログを読んでくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また来てね~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "山田桃実"}], "source": "official"}